.TH MAIL "1" "" "FSF" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
mail \- manual page for mail (GNU Mailutils)
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mail
[\fIOPTION\fR...] [\fIaddress\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
GNU mail \fB\-\-\fR the standard /bin/mail interface
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
Report bugs to <bug-mailutils@gnu.org>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
The full documentation for
.B mail
is maintained as a Texinfo manual.  If the
.B info
and
.B mail
programs are properly installed at your site, the command
.IP
.B info mail
.PP
should give you access to the complete manual.
